    "https://jobs.apply.vt.edu/jobs/postdoctoral-associate-blacksburg-virginia-united-states-b7cef51e-70dc-4ab8-8dee-138888069497": {
      "title": "Postdoctoral Associate",
      "description": "Postdoctoral Associate - Blacksburg, Virginia, United States Postdoctoral Associate - Blacksburg, Virginia, United States Kiosk mode Claim your role Search by job title, location, department, category, etc. Search Postdoctoral Associate 538230 Blacksburg, Virginia Biological Systems Engineering Research Faculty Agriculture & Life Sciences Job Description The Department of Biological Systems Engineering at Virginia Tech is seeking a Postdoctoral Associate. The project will focus on “engineering biomaterial platforms for drug and gene delivery”. Nanoformulations or devices will be engineered for enhancing the efficacy and safety of biologically active drugs and gene therapies. The selected individual will work with Dr. Wujin Sun and a team of researchers at Virginia Tech. The selected individual will lead biomaterial design, device fabrication, and formulation characterization. Required Qualifications - PhD must be awarded no more than four years prior to the effective date of the appointment with a minimum of one year eligibility remaining in pharmaceutical engineering, polymer science, materials science and engineering, chemical engineering, biomedical engineering, biological systems engineering, chemistry, or related scientific or engineering field - Self-motivated individual who shows initiative and creativity - Effective communication skills Preferred Qualifications - Experience with hydrogel or polymer synthesis and characterization - Experience with microneedle or transdermal delivery device fabrication - Experience with controlled release formulation - Experience with bioconjugation or surface functionalization - Experience with in vitro cell studies Overtime Status Exempt: Not eligible for overtime Appointment Type Restricted Salary Information $53,550-$65,029; commensurate with experience Hours per week 40 Review Date 11/03/2026 Additional Information The successful candidate will be required to have a criminal conviction check. About Virginia Tech Dedicated to its motto, Ut Prosim (That I May Serve), Virginia Tech pushes the boundaries of knowledge by taking a hands-on, transdisciplinary approach to preparing scholars to be leaders and problem-solvers. A comprehensive land-grant institution that enhances the quality of life in Virginia and throughout the world, Virginia Tech is an inclusive community dedicated to knowledge, discovery, and creativity. The university offers more than 280 majors to a diverse enrollment of more than 36,000 undergraduate, graduate, and professional students in eight undergraduate colleges , a school of medicine , a veterinary medicine college, Graduate School , and Honors College . The university has a significant presence across Virginia, including Blacksburg, the greater Washington, D.C. area, the Health Sciences and Technology Campus in Roanoke, sites in Newport News and Richmond, and numerous Extension offices and research institutes . A leading global research institution, Virginia Tech conducts more than $650 million in research annually. Virginia Tech endorses and encourages participation in professional development opportunities and university shared governance . These valuable contributions to university shared governance provide important representation and perspective, along with opportunities for unique and impactful professional development. Virginia Tech does not discriminate against employees, students, or applicants on the basis of age, color, disability, sex (including pregnancy), gender, gender identity, gender expression, genetic information, ethnicity or national origin, political affiliation, race, religion, sexual orientation, or military status, or otherwise discriminate against employees or applicants who inquire about, discuss, or disclose their compensation or the compensation of other employees or applicants, or on any other basis protected by law. If you are an individual with a disability and desire an accommodation, please contact Dr. Wujin Sun at sunw@vt.edu during regular business hours at least 10 business days prior to the event. Back to job search Apply Now! First Name (required) c2c146d4 Last Name (required) 011cb2f0 Email (required) 91e31ec9 Apply Please wait... Done Not You? By submitting this form, you consent to receive text messages related to available jobs and information about working at Virginia Tech. Message & data rates may apply. Message frequency varies. Unsubscribe at any time by replying STOP or clicking the unsubscribe link (where available). By submitting your information, you acknowledge that you have read and agree to our Privacy Policy and our SMS terms & conditions . Thank you! Sign Up For Job Alerts Job Alert 2ec360ce Finalize your job alert by selecting criteria from the dropdowns below. You can select multiple options from each dropdown by returning to the combobox and re-entering the list of options. Submit at the end to create your job alert. Categories Agriculture / Life Science Research / Scientific Agriculture / Life Science Research / Scientific Locations Blacksburg, Virginia Blacksburg, Virginia Senior Management Agriculture & Life Sciences Agriculture & Life Sciences First Name (required) eb8eed09 Last Name (required) 01dc2807 Email (required) 34d8a40c Send Please wait... Done Not You? By submitting this form, you consent to receive text messages related to available jobs and information about working at Virginia Tech. Message & data rates may apply. Message frequency varies. Unsubscribe at any time by replying STOP or clicking the unsubscribe link (where available). By submitting your information, you acknowledge that you have read and agree to our Privacy Policy and our SMS terms & conditions . Thank you! Send Me This Job or Refer a Friend First Name (required) 7e18c507 Last Name (required) 761593da Email (required) 265e72b5 Send Please wait... Done Not You? By submitting this form, you consent to receive text messages related to available jobs and information