      "description": "Instructor - Blacksburg, Virginia, United States Instructor - Blacksburg, Virginia, United States Kiosk mode Claim your role Search by job title, location, department, category, etc. Search Instructor 537446 Blacksburg, Virginia Mechanical Engineering Teaching & Research Faculty College of Engineering Job Description The Department of Mechanical Engineering at Virginia Tech is seeking applications for a teaching faculty position at the Instructor rank with an anticipated start date of August 2027. The successful candidate will be responsible for teaching undergraduate courses in thermodynamics, fluid dynamics, heat and mass transfer, and related fields. Instructors have a commitment to the instructional mission of the department, with a primary focus on undergraduate teaching, curricular and program development, and the design and integration of innovative pedagogy. Required Qualifications Applicants must hold a PhD degree in Mechanical Engineering or a closely related discipline by the start time of their appointment. Preferred Qualifications Teaching experience as the lead instructor in mechanical engineering undergraduate courses is preferred. Overtime Status Exempt: Not eligible for overtime Appointment Type Restricted Hours per week 40 Review Date October 9, 2026 Additional Information The successful candidate will be required to have a criminal conviction check. About Virginia Tech Dedicated to its motto, Ut Prosim (That I May Serve), Virginia Tech pushes the boundaries of knowledge by taking a hands-on, transdisciplinary approach to preparing scholars to be leaders and problem-solvers. A comprehensive land-grant institution that enhances the quality of life in Virginia and throughout the world, Virginia Tech is an inclusive community dedicated to knowledge, discovery, and creativity. The university offers more than 280 majors to a diverse enrollment of more than 36,000 undergraduate, graduate, and professional students in eight undergraduate colleges , a school of medicine , a veterinary medicine college, Graduate School , and Honors College . The university has a significant presence across Virginia, including Blacksburg, the greater Washington, D.C. area, the Health Sciences and Technology Campus in Roanoke, sites in Newport News and Richmond, and numerous Extension offices and research institutes . A leading global research institution, Virginia Tech conducts more than $650 million in research annually. Virginia Tech endorses and encourages participation in professional development opportunities and university shared governance . These valuable contributions to university shared governance provide important representation and perspective, along with opportunities for unique and impactful professional development. Virginia Tech does not discriminate against employees, students, or applicants on the basis of age, color, disability, sex (including pregnancy), gender, gender identity, gender expression, genetic information, ethnicity or national origin, political affiliation, race, religion, sexual orientation, or military status, or otherwise discriminate against employees or applicants who inquire about, discuss, or disclose their compensation or the compensation of other employees or applicants, or on any other basis protected by law. If you are an individual with a disability and desire an accommodation, please contact Amanda Collins at mandamcg@vt.edu during regular business hours at least 10 business days prior to the event. Back to job search Apply Now! First Name (required) 94adc75a Last Name (required) 539a1055 Email (required) 7c9f1ed2 Apply Please wait... Done Not You? By submitting this form, you consent to receive text messages related to available jobs and information about working at Virginia Tech. Message & data rates may apply. Message frequency varies. Unsubscribe at any time by replying STOP or clicking the unsubscribe link (where available). By submitting your information, you acknowledge that you have read and agree to our Privacy Policy and our SMS terms & conditions . Thank you! Sign Up For Job Alerts Job Alert 99218307 Finalize your job alert by selecting criteria from the dropdowns below. You can select multiple options from each dropdown by returning to the combobox and re-entering the list of options. Submit at the end to create your job alert. Categories Engineering Research / Scientific Engineering Research / Scientific Locations Blacksburg, Virginia Blacksburg, Virginia Senior Management College of Engineering College of Engineering First Name (required) e480a92b Last Name (required) 1df310cf Email (required) 2c8be41a Send Please wait... Done Not You? By submitting this form, you consent to receive text messages related to available jobs and information about working at Virginia Tech. Message & data rates may apply. Message frequency varies. Unsubscribe at any time by replying STOP or clicking the unsubscribe link (where available). By submitting your information, you acknowledge that you have read and agree to our Privacy Policy and our SMS terms & conditions . Thank you! Send Me This Job or Refer a Friend First Name (required) 2fcbea30 Last Name (required) c469beb2 Email (required) f0e66fe5 Send Please wait... Done Not You? By submitting this form, you consent to receive text messages related to available jobs and information about working at Virginia Tech. Message & data rates may apply. Message frequency varies. Unsubscribe at any time by replying STOP or clicking the unsubscribe link (where available). By submitting your information, you acknowledge that you have read and agree to our Privacy Policy and our SMS terms & conditions . Thank you! Recommended Jobs For You Agricultural Technician-Suffolk, VA Suffolk Virginia Tidewater AREC Virginia Tech's Tidewater Agricultural Research and Extension Center (AREC) is seeking a dedicated and detail-oriented Research Technician to assist our dynamic field crops agronomy and soybean research program. This is an off-campus, part-time position located at our facility in Suffolk, Virginia. You will work under the direction of the Agricultural Supervisor to support the lifecycle of small-plot agricultural research, from seed packaging to precision planting, field data collection, and post-harvest quality analysis. Administrative & Fiscal Assistant - Northampton Machiponogo, Virginia Virginia Southeast District Coop. Extension Virginia Cooperative Extension is seeking an Administrative & Fiscal Assistant for Northampton County. Administrative & Fiscal Assistant - York County Yorktown Virginia Southeast District Coop. Extension Virginia Cooperative Extension is seeking an Administrative & Fiscal Assistant for York County. Candidate Details “This website uses cookies to improve your experience. We use cookies to personalize job recommendations, understand site traffic, and enhance your interaction with our career site. By clicking ‘I Accept’, you consent to our use of cookies. By clicking ‘I Do Not Accept’, only essential cookies will be used, but certain features may not function as intended. You can change your cookie settings at any time by clicking ‘Manage Cookies’. For more information, please review our Privacy Policy.” Manage Consent Preferences Strictly Necessary Cookies Performance Cookies Manage Cookies I do not accept I accept Save Please choose a senior management"
